{"product_id":"natures-masterpiece","title":"Nature's Masterpiece","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe family is nature's masterpiece' - George Santayana A compendium of practical advice and reflections on modern family life in the age of computer gaming, ever younger drug and drink problems, educational upheaval and concerns about the way children's freedom, health and personal development are threatened by considerations of safety. Libby also considers the maintenance of marriage in an age of rising divorce and stepfamilies, a balanced approach to sexual threats to children, and the dangers and opportunities for family life caused by dual careers, teleworking, and other trends in the modern workplace. Each subject is treated with wit and brevity to make the book a delight to read as well as providing a fund of useful advice.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 0 x 220\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Libby Purves\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780340751350\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 382\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45368081481881,"sku":"15RA-4-9780340751350","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6818869a1e6ac_Nature_s_Masterpiece_Libby_Purves.jpg?v=1746547932","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/natures-masterpiece","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}